  "product_overview": "ComplicesConecta is a secure and discreet social platform for adults 18+, focused on verified connections, privacy, token economy, and AI-assisted interactions. The platform offers demo mode, multi-factor authentication, real-time chat, profile discovery, events, and marketplace features with strong compliance to legal requirements.",
  "core_goals": [
    "Provide a secure and verified social connection platform for adults +18.",
    "Enable seamless user authentication with optional MFA and security monitoring.",
    "Support smooth user flows from registration and demo to discovery, matching, and chat.",
    "Implement real-time chat with private gallery unlocking controlled by token payments.",
    "Integrate an economy based on tokens (CMPX) and NFTs for enhanced user experience.",
    "Ensure responsive and intuitive navigation across devices (mobile, tablet, desktop).",
    "Offer admin and moderation tools with role-based protected routes.",
    "Guarantee compliance with relevant legal regulations including Ley Olimpia MX.",
    "Maintain high quality through comprehensive automated testing (unit, integration, e2e, security)."
  ],
  "key_features": [
    "Authentication & Security with login/registration, MFA, and security monitoring including demo mode.",
    "User flow for Discover → Likes → Matches enabling connection and chat access upon match.",
    "Real-time Chat with private gallery unlock feature controlled by CMPX tokens and NFT integration.",
    "Tokens and Wallet UI displaying CMPX/GTK tokens, dashboards, and token system navigation.",
    "Responsive navigation and UX for mobile, tablet, and desktop with top/bottom navigation.",
    "Demo Mode allowing quick product tours without real credentials, including an AppFactory and dedicated demo screens.",
    "Profile management supporting single/couple profiles with detailed views and editable layouts.",
    "Events and Clubs pages featuring verified listings and upcoming clubs.",
    "Administrative and Moderation interfaces with role-protected routes for user and content management.",
    "AI Help and AI Control Center providing integrated assistance and control.",
    "Marketplace, Shop, and NFTs screens for token-based commerce and premium content.",
    "Legal and Info pages covering terms of service, privacy policy, support, and compliance information.",
    "Comprehensive automated testing suites covering unit, integration, e2e, and security to ensure product quality."
  ],
  "user_flow_summary": [
    "User accesses landing page and chooses between demo mode or real registration at /auth or /demo.",
    "Upon authentication, optional MFA verification and security validations are performed before granting access.",
    "Users navigate through discovery of profiles at /discover, liking and generating matches accessible at /matches.",
    "Users can engage in real-time chat at /chat once a match is achieved with private gallery contents unlockable via token payments.",
    "Token dashboards and information panels are accessible via /tokens providing user insights into CMPX/GTK balances and transactions.",
    "Users can explore verified Events and Clubs listings at /events and /clubs respectively.",
    "Admin and moderation roles access their respective dashboards and management screens through protected routes with role checks.",
    "AI help functionalities are accessible through the AI Control Center for assistance and moderation support.",
    "Legal and information pages are available for user reference regarding compliance and platform guidelines.",
    "All flows include responsive navigation and UX across mobile, tablet, and desktop devices."
  ],
  "validation_criteria": [
    "Authentication screens must be responsive, interactive, and support MFA with clear error feedback.",
    "Demo mode must allow quick and frictionless product exploration without real credentials.",
    "Discovery flow must allow liking profiles and reflect matches accurately in matches UI.",
    "Chat functionality should enable real-time messaging and restrict access appropriately when no session exists.",
    "Private gallery content must respect blur or locked status and follow the token unlock process reliably.",
    "Token screens must render dashboards correctly and support smooth navigation.",
    "Navigation components should function flawlessly across all device viewports without UI obstruction.",
    "Admin and moderation panels must restrict access by roles and function without errors.",
    "AI help features should be accessible and provide relevant assistance.",
    "Marketplace and NFT features must render correctly and avoid UI crashes especially in incomplete features.",
    "Automated test suites should cover critical paths including auth, discover, match, chat, gallery unlock, and tokens without regressions."
  ],
